        "created_at": "2015-11-19T16:16:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sure, but I don't mind seeing Light Speed Barrage later in the game, that means I would be drawing more valuable early card games and not have my hand crowded with cards that I probably won't use until the moment they can take out the villain. So not seeing it for awhile is just fine by me.</p>",
